{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/extras/cb01391b6ab779eba90419bf5ab4c2ba.poster.avif?t=1754299562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/extras/cb01391b6ab779eba90419bf5ab4c2ba.webm?t=1754299562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>This demo lets you discover the <strong>foundations of the game</strong> through a playable slice set between <strong>1906 and 1914</strong>, during the early rise of movie theaters in Paris. You\u2019ll play as a young theater owner, guided step-by-step by a <strong>complete tutorial</strong> teaching you the game\u2019s core systems: film scheduling, reel purchasing, pricing strategy, room layout, revenue management, and technical upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the tutorial is complete, you\u2019ll be free to develop your cinema as you wish. Whether you dream of an early-day multiplex or a refined arthouse venue, <strong>the demo gives you full freedom up to 1914</strong>, with no time limit or artificial restriction. Estimated playtime: 2 to 4 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/extras/5c885e7f7678bd5a5204d34f4cda5f18.poster.avif?t=1754299562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/extras/5c885e7f7678bd5a5204d34f4cda5f18.webm?t=1754299562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into Cinema Tycoon, the ultimate cinema management game! Start your journey in 1906 in Paris, just after the first screenings by the Lumi\u00e8re brothers, and thrive for more than 100 years of cinematic evolution. Whether managing a small independent cinema or the world's most prestigious theater, every decision you make will shape the future of your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/extras/291a1e0c61a248ef4f123af3f2b6f5d7.poster.avif?t=1754299562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/extras/291a1e0c61a248ef4f123af3f2b6f5d7.webm?t=1754299562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Cinema Theater Tycoon, customization is at the heart of your success. Build and modify every aspect of your cinemas, from floor to ceiling, with hundreds of items. Create unique screening rooms, upgrade your equipment, and choose every detail with precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/extras/313de7e92bd9c39ce918196f9438ffd7.poster.avif?t=1754299562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/extras/313de7e92bd9c39ce918196f9438ffd7.webm?t=1754299562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relive the key moments in cinema history. From silent films to modern blockbusters, each era is represented with its movies, technologies, and trends. Cult classics, world premieres, and seasonal events will bring your cinema to life across the decades. Host premieres, masterclasses, and film clubs to attract stars and moviegoers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/extras/1fbe37e8e841a23097239efb04b6a2d5.poster.avif?t=1754299562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/extras/1fbe37e8e841a23097239efb04b6a2d5.webm?t=1754299562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage every aspect of your cinema, from programming to staff, ticket and popcorn prices, and ensure your theaters are always ready for the next big premiere. Send your film buyers across the globe to find THE perfect movie.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/extras/4d0fdd5da351b573b97138f947ee0264.poster.avif?t=1754299562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/extras/4d0fdd5da351b573b97138f947ee0264.webm?t=1754299562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the challenges of the trade, from fires to projector breakdowns, and navigate tough historical periods like the world wars. Will you keep your cinema profitable while weathering these eras?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842790?t=1754299562","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/2c89ce92813acd31a0ec78bc67be7a5a42ea7944/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754299562","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/67371412bb72449185cbb8c8f8a1b6261e448444/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754299562","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842790/67371412bb72449185cbb8c8f8a1b6261e448444/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754299562","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67